{"4714830": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Desert Echo", "steam_appid": 4714830, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not human. You never were. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Echo is an artificial consciousness — endlessly recurring, endlessly rebuilt. When your chassis falls, the Core resurrects you. When the Core falls, there is nothing left to come back to. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE ECHO CORE </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Echo Core is everything. It stabilizes the Dimensional Rifts tearing reality apart. It anchors your existence. Destroy it, and the rifts consume what remains. Protect it — or stop existing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714830/extras/8b56af878d0d5f5134af7fbd03b065ed.avif?t=1788020047\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714830/extras_big/8b56af878d0d5f5134af7fbd03b065ed.webp?t=1788020047 width=1560 height=748 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DIMENSIONAL DRIFT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A giant sphere floats above the desert floor, dragging a portal into existence. A purple light descends — slowly, inevitably. Watch the timer. When the light hits the sphere, the vortex opens and they pour through. You cannot stop it. You can only be ready.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHAT IS DESERT ECHO?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Desert Echo is a sci-fi horde defense game built around endless wave survival, tactical turret deployment, and cooperative chaos. Hold the line. Spend wisely. Don't let them through.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714830/extras/baabbbfef398c919444b89bd086ec69e.avif?t=1788020047\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714830/extras_big/baabbbfef398c919444b89bd086ec69e.webp?t=1788020047 width=1560 height=845 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Wave Survival</strong> - Face relentless enemy swarms that grow in scale and aggression with every wave. No checkpoints. No mercy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714830/extras/02b949c6310debce4a1450f3cc13155d.avif?t=1788020047\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714830/extras_big/02b949c6310debce4a1450f3cc13155d.webp?t=1788020047 width=1560 height=684 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714830/extras/4c5d023740ea088678dc754e2fd45010.avif?t=1788020047\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714830/extras_big/4c5d023740ea088678dc754e2fd45010.webp?t=1788020047 width=1560 height=684 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714830/extras/ca43509a8fe7e6f6040fbb5a7f3bcb08.avif?t=1788020047\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714830/extras_big/ca43509a8fe7e6f6040fbb5a7f3bcb08.webp?t=1788020047 width=1560 height=684 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First &amp; Third Person</strong> – Switch perspective at any time. Line up precise shots in first person, or pull back to third when the swarm closes in from every side.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hundreds of Enemies On Screen</strong> - Powered by a high-performance swarm system, the battlefield floods with hundreds of enemies simultaneously without compromise.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714830/extras/f8fb3b76d5048f2af7024a37190e3a83.avif?t=1788020047\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714830/extras_big/f8fb3b76d5048f2af7024a37190e3a83.webp?t=1788020047 width=1560 height=707 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714830/extras/30c76682bfcc0308a61c52b4db87af84.avif?t=1788020047\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714830/extras_big/30c76682bfcc0308a61c52b4db87af84.webp?t=1788020047 width=1560 height=707 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714830/extras/a5ed980de5c69d3534e768d2ebc0e8f8.avif?t=1788020047\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714830/extras_big/a5ed980de5c69d3534e768d2ebc0e8f8.webp?t=1788020047 width=1560 height=707 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turret Building, Gas Barrels</strong> <strong>&amp; Economy</strong> - Deploy static turrets, position explosive gas barrels, and spend your Energy Fragments wisely. Every placement is a decision. Every barrel is a trap waiting to happen.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714830/extras/7757f9d710600203008825cc8a24e2ff.avif?t=1788020047\" width=828 height=424 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op Multiplayer</strong> - Fight alongside a friend in Steam-powered co-op. Coordinate, cover, survive together — or fall apart trying.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Echo's Story</strong> - Uncover the fragmented truth behind your existence through environmental storytelling, NPC encounters, and Echo's own inner monologue.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Weather and Sandstorm</strong> - Walls of sand sweep across the canyon, stripping visibility and turning the battlefield into chaos. Survive the storm and survive what comes within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714830/extras/a5d880b086d3497e9cd588ac2d52b378.avif?t=1788020047\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714830/extras_big/a5d880b086d3497e9cd588ac2d52b378.webp?t=1788020047 width=1560 height=845 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The desert doesn't forgive hesitation. Neither do they.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not human. You never were. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Echo is an artificial consciousness — endlessly recurring, endlessly rebuilt. When your chassis falls, the Core resurrects you. When the Core falls, there is nothing left to come back to. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE ECHO CORE </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Echo Core is everything. It stabilizes the Dimensional Rifts tearing reality apart. It anchors your existence. Destroy it, and the rifts consume what remains. Protect it — or stop existing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714830/extras/8b56af878d0d5f5134af7fbd03b065ed.avif?t=1788020047\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714830/extras_big/8b56af878d0d5f5134af7fbd03b065ed.webp?t=1788020047 width=1560 height=748 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DIMENSIONAL DRIFT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A giant sphere floats above the desert floor, dragging a portal into existence. A purple light descends — slowly, inevitably. Watch the timer. When the light hits the sphere, the vortex opens and they pour through. You cannot stop it. You can only be ready.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHAT IS DESERT ECHO?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Desert Echo is a sci-fi horde defense game built around endless wave survival, tactical turret deployment, and cooperative chaos. Hold the line. Spend wisely. Don't let them through.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714830/extras/baabbbfef398c919444b89bd086ec69e.avif?t=1788020047\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714830/extras_big/baabbbfef398c919444b89bd086ec69e.webp?t=1788020047 width=1560 height=845 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Wave Survival</strong> - Face relentless enemy swarms that grow in scale and aggression with every wave. No checkpoints. No mercy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714830/extras/02b949c6310debce4a1450f3cc13155d.avif?t=1788020047\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714830/extras_big/02b949c6310debce4a1450f3cc13155d.webp?t=1788020047 width=1560 height=684 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714830/extras/4c5d023740ea088678dc754e2fd45010.avif?t=1788020047\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714830/extras_big/4c5d023740ea088678dc754e2fd45010.webp?t=1788020047 width=1560 height=684 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714830/extras/ca43509a8fe7e6f6040fbb5a7f3bcb08.avif?t=1788020047\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714830/extras_big/ca43509a8fe7e6f6040fbb5a7f3bcb08.webp?t=1788020047 width=1560 height=684 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First &amp; Third Person</strong> – Switch perspective at any time. Line up precise shots in first person, or pull back to third when the swarm closes in from every side.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hundreds of Enemies On Screen</strong> - Powered by a high-performance swarm system, the battlefield floods with hundreds of enemies simultaneously without compromise.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714830/extras/f8fb3b76d5048f2af7024a37190e3a83.avif?t=1788020047\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714830/extras_big/f8fb3b76d5048f2af7024a37190e3a83.webp?t=1788020047 width=1560 height=707 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714830/extras/30c76682bfcc0308a61c52b4db87af84.avif?t=1788020047\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714830/extras_big/30c76682bfcc0308a61c52b4db87af84.webp?t=1788020047 width=1560 height=707 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714830/extras/a5ed980de5c69d3534e768d2ebc0e8f8.avif?t=1788020047\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714830/extras_big/a5ed980de5c69d3534e768d2ebc0e8f8.webp?t=1788020047 width=1560 height=707 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turret Building, Gas Barrels</strong> <strong>&amp; Economy</strong> - Deploy static turrets, position explosive gas barrels, and spend your Energy Fragments wisely. Every placement is a decision. Every barrel is a trap waiting to happen.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714830/extras/7757f9d710600203008825cc8a24e2ff.avif?t=1788020047\" width=828 height=424 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op Multiplayer</strong> - Fight alongside a friend in Steam-powered co-op. Coordinate, cover, survive together — or fall apart trying.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Echo's Story</strong> - Uncover the fragmented truth behind your existence through environmental storytelling, NPC encounters, and Echo's own inner monologue.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Weather and Sandstorm</strong> - Walls of sand sweep across the canyon, stripping visibility and turning the battlefield into chaos. Survive the storm and survive what comes within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714830/extras/a5d880b086d3497e9cd588ac2d52b378.avif?t=1788020047\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714830/extras_big/a5d880b086d3497e9cd588ac2d52b378.webp?t=1788020047 width=1560 height=845 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The desert doesn't forgive hesitation. Neither do they.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "You are Echo, an AI consciousness, endlessly rebuilt. Defend the Core against relentless swarms, dimensional Rifts and sandstorms. Hundreds of enemies on screen. Deploy turrets, gas barrels, farm energy fragments. No checkpoints. No mercy. Solo or co-op. The desert doesn't forgive hesitation.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714830/a178064d68e7e4735e2cbe32eea906853c08a4cc/header.jpg?t=1788020047", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714830/ed7ebd6213384c03620d461ebbe425d6eaf3f3e0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788020047", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714830/ed7ebd6213384c03620d461ebbe425d6eaf3f3e0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788020047", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit (Version 1909 or later)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 5600 / Intel Core i5-10400 (6 cores)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2060 6GB / AMD Radeon RX 5600 XT 6GB / Intel Arc A580 (Shader Model 6 / DirectX 12 required)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Optimized for desktop PC. SSD strongly recommended for Nanite streaming. Steam Deck support may come in future updates.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 7 5800X3D / Intel Core i5-13600K (8 cores)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 32 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong